config DEMO_GPIO_IRQ
	tristate "Educational GPIO and IRQ monitor"
	depends on GPIOLIB
	depends on OF || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Build an educational platform driver that requests presence, fault,
	  and reset GPIO descriptors, maps input GPIOs to threaded IRQs, and
	  exposes simple diagnostic attributes. This is a study example, not a
	  production board-management policy driver.

